        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suika Sprunki Edition</strong> is a vibrant arcade puzzle game inspired by the classic Suika formula, but with the unmistakable madness of the Sprunki universe. Drop character heads into a container and watch them bounce, collide, and merge into strange, evolving forms. What starts as a simple mechanic quickly becomes a thrilling challenge of timing, precision, and strategy. Don’t let the box overflow—score high and unlock even weirder evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: as your score climbs, the game begins to shift. The cheerful rhythm stutters, the atmosphere darkens, and before you know it, you’ve slipped into <strong>Horror Mode</strong>, where familiar faces twist into something uncanny and the music begins to press on your nerves. It’s the same game—but seen through a distorted mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.poster.avif?t=1754636992\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.webm?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.mp4?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside you’ll find:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Cross-platform leaderboard: fight for the top spot no matter where you play<br>– Beloved Sprunki characters: merge, explode, and watch them evolve<br>– A soundtrack that sticks with you: from playful tunes to unsettling hums<br>– A bold and slightly unhinged visual style: mesmerizing from the first drop</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suika Sprunki Edition</strong> is a vibrant arcade puzzle game inspired by the classic Suika formula, but with the unmistakable madness of the Sprunki universe. Drop character heads into a container and watch them bounce, collide, and merge into strange, evolving forms. What starts as a simple mechanic quickly becomes a thrilling challenge of timing, precision, and strategy. Don’t let the box overflow—score high and unlock even weirder evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: as your score climbs, the game begins to shift. The cheerful rhythm stutters, the atmosphere darkens, and before you know it, you’ve slipped into <strong>Horror Mode</strong>, where familiar faces twist into something uncanny and the music begins to press on your nerves. It’s the same game—but seen through a distorted mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.poster.avif?t=1754636992\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.webm?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.mp4?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside you’ll find:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Cross-platform leaderboard: fight for the top spot no matter where you play<br>– Beloved Sprunki characters: merge, explode, and watch them evolve<br>– A soundtrack that sticks with you: from playful tunes to unsettling hums<br>– A bold and slightly unhinged visual style: mesmerizing from the first drop</p>",
        "short_description": "Suika Sprunki Edition is a fun puzzle game where you drop and match Sprunki heads to unlock new forms. The higher you score, the closer you get to the creepy Horror Mode — and the top of the leaderboard. Can you reach the final form — Black?",
